<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rises to 70.4554 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rises to 70.4554 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge rose to 70.4554 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 70.5715 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 7		   Nov 6</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  70.4554		 70.5715</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	     3.620		   3.590</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    47.1000		 46.7827</p>
<p>    volume (DM million)	    0.020		   0.665</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
